<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ broker Garlick &amp; Co lays off staff - sources.</title>
<headline>NZ broker Garlick &amp; Co lays off staff - sources.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand stockbroker and fixed income trader Garlick &amp; Co has laid off some staff, Wellington broking sources said on Thursday.</p>
<p>A company source confirmed some staff had been laid off but said that only Managing Director Bill Garlick was able to supply details.</p>
<p>Garlick was out of the office and not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom +64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
